  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>)</mo></math> be defined as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>x</mi></msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>]</mo></math> is the greatest integer less than or equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>. Which of the following is true?</p>"
